<section class="container">
    <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="profile-section">
            <img src="https://dataled.co/images/brian-o-sullivan-vertical.png" alt="Brian O'Sullivan" class="profile-image">
        </div>

        <div class="bio-section">
            <p class="bio-text">With nearly two decades in tech I have experience with FAANG all the way to bootstrapped startups with <1$m ARR. I started my career at Google working with Europe's largest online brands on ads and analytics for 9 years, then as a Senior Growth Product Manager at Dropbox running experiments worth millions in revenue.</p>

            <p class="bio-text">After leading growth at two Series A SaaS companies (including taking Leadfeeder from 0% to 100% YOY growth), I now work as an independent consultant specializing in analytics, optimization, and strategy.</p>

            <p class="bio-text">I've spoken about growth at events across Dublin, Edinburgh, Brussels, Stockholm, London, Amsterdam, and Moscow, and have guest lectured on MSc courses.</p>

            <p class="bio-text">I live in Ireland with my wife and two kids. When I'm not working, you'll find me outdoors—surfing, mountain biking, or training for my next triathlon.</p>
   
</div>
